        "TileImage": "$($repository 50f85ca0-2527-4523-a34e-339cd4edc979).Image",
        "Description": "47. \r\rThis is it. The final set of High Value Targets. The first five that are located at Vinedo Yates in Mendoza, Argentina are listed below, as well as the preferred methods for dealing with them;\r\rEliminate Juan Cortazar with fiber wire. \rEliminate Corvo Black in an accidental explosion.\rEliminate Aron Ford Jr. (AGAIN) with injected poison. \rEliminate Kenneth Flowers with a pistol headshot.\rEliminate Valentina Yates from a fall.\r\rIt has been an honour, make me proud.. Happy hunting!\rReapingZ",
